### Product Management Requests

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = your-jwt-token-here
@productId = product-id-here
@categoryId = category-id-here

### Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get all products with query parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category={{categoryId}}&available=true&limit=10

### Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Create pizza product (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Margherita Pizza",
  "description": "Classic pizza with tomato sauce, mozzarella, and fresh basil",
  "price": 12.99,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "available": true,
  "ingredients": ["tomato sauce", "mozzarella", "basil"],
  "allergens": ["dairy", "gluten"]
}

### Create beverage product (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Coca Cola",
  "description": "Classic soft drink",
  "price": 2.50,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "available": true,
  "size": "330ml"
}

### Create dessert product (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Tiramisu",
  "description": "Traditional Italian dessert with coffee and mascarpone",
  "price": 6.99,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "available": true,
  "allergens": ["dairy", "eggs", "gluten"]
}

### Update product (requires authentication)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Updated Pizza Name",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 14.99,
  "available": false
}

### Delete product (requires authentication)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}} 